//! Floating-point and Advanced SIMD extensions.

/// Scalar floating-point operations on the AArch64 SIMD and floating-point register file.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, A64 floating-point instructions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa FP requires ARMv8A64 {}
/// Advanced SIMD operations over packed lanes in the AArch64 vector register file.
///
/// See [Arm Architecture Reference Manual, A64 Advanced SIMD instructions](https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest/).
isa AdvSIMD requires [ARMv8A64, FP] {}
